      "description": "On each new pregnancy, appends the mother's and father's names, their ages at conception, their head and body values, and the number of babies to 'Virtual Villagers 5 Parentage Log N.txt' beside the game executable. Parentage is not stored in any villager record, so both parents are captured at conception; they cannot be recovered from the child afterwards. Village seeding is excluded, so a new village does not write a record for every starting villager. Rolls to a new numbered file every 256 records.",
